# Start with a question

What can you explain or build today?

---
## Learn → apply → check

Read Concepts. Trace a worked example. Complete the lab. Attempt the quiz. Read Feedback.

---
## Use the evidence

Choose a topic-linked past question. Read its own instructions. Attempt it. Check the matching year and level scheme.

---
## Return to the gap

Record one misconception and a new practice task. Repeat after an interval.
